:: Witch Intro
<<location "prutihut">>
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<callDoll>>
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>
You awaken from your stupor feeling oddly... stiff. When you try to move, you hear a sharp click. A cursory glance at your body reveals your skin to be some kind of rubbery false skin. You gasp in horror, but you fail to make a sound. Whatever happened to your body seems to be somewhat impeding your ability to talk. You're about to make an attempt to ascertain your surroundings when you notice a shadow looming over you. You look up.
<br><br>
It takes you a few seconds to mentally grasp what you're seeing. There appears to be a <<personsimple>> with a smug expression on <<his>> face standing above you. "Good morning, doll," <<he>> purrs. "It seems the ritual worked perfectly."
<br><br>
The <<personsimple>> introduces <<himself>> as Pruti, a powerful witch with a penchant for turning <<his>> enemies into inanimate objects. <<He>> explains that <<he>> conducted a ritual on you to place your soul into a doll, and that you'll remain in this state until <<he>> decides otherwise.
<br><br>
Suddenly, a swarm of elongated arms appear and begin brushing through your hair and face, as if they were getting you ready for your day. "There, there, my little doll," the <<personsimple>> whispers. "Now you belong to me. You will do everything I say, understand?"
<br><br>
"Don't worry," <<he>> adds, "I'll take good care of you. I'm sure you'll make a adorable addition to my collection."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut]]>><<set $prutibinding to 20>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Witch Hut
<<set $tiredness -= 1000>>
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<towelup>>
<</if>>
<<set $fatigue to 0>>
<<if $prutibinding is 0>>
	<span class="red">
		The bindings slip and break away.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 5>>
	<span class="pink">
		The bindings feel very loose and nearly fall off.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 10>>
	<span class="purple">
		The bindings still feel quite firm.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 15>>
	<span class="blue">
		The bindings hold strong against any struggle you can manage.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 20>>
	<span class="lblue">
		The bindings are pristine and strong.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<</if>>


<<if $NPCName[$NPCNameList.indexOf("Pruti")].love gte 40 and Time.dayState is "day">>
	<<set $syndromepruti to 1>>
	Suddenly, your bindings loosen and disappear. Pruti approaches you and whispers into your ear. "You've been good thus far. You can move around but don't even think about leaving. Got it?" <<He>> steps back and lets you stand before returning to what <<he>> was doing. <<He>> doesn't seem to mind as you return to your original form.
	<br><br>
	<<sleepDoll>><<stress -1000>>
	<span class="red">You've gained the Stockholm Syndrome: Pruti trait.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<if $bodyless is 1>>
        <<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>>
            <<set Skin.color.natural to "ghost">>
            <<set V.transformationParts.ghost.eyes to "default">>
            <<set V.transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "default">>
            <<set $haircolour to "ghost">>
            <<set $hairfringecolour to "ghost">>
            <<set $makeup.browscolour to "ghost">>
            <<set $options.lightGlow to 1>>
            <<set $ghost to 1>>
        <</link>>
    <<else>>
        <<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><</link>>
    <</if>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 6>>
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti lies still in <<his>> bed asleep. If anything, now is your time to act.
	<br><br>
	<<if $prutibinding gt 0>>
		<<link [[Try to break your bindings (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<set $prutibinding -= 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Flee (0:30)|Witch Hut Flee]]>><<pass 30>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 8 and $prutibinding is 0>>
	You start to fall asleep before you're awaken with a start by Pruti. "What's this?!" <<He>> yells as he finds your bindings broken. "Your bindings broke overnight and... you chose to stay? I... W-wait..." <<He>> seems confused. "Do you not want to be free?" <<He>> mutters confused to <<himself>> as <<he>> fixes your bindings and walks away.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 5>><<set $prutibinding to 20>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>
