:: Pruti Potion Use
You throw the potion toward Pruti who, without flinching, smashes the glass, spreading the liquid through the room. Pruti lets out a gutteral growl and cleans <<his>> face with <<his>> long tongue. "This is your last warning..." <<He>> pants as <<he>> gets into a pouncing stance <<his>> eyes wild.
<br><br>
<<link [[Surrender|Pruti Punishment]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
