:: Pruti Sendoff
<<npc "Pruti">>
Pruti sees you eyeing the door and sighs annoyed. "You do want to leave don't you?" <<He>> grumbles. "Look I don't usually do this... but I could free you and let you go." <<He>> seems to be having a hard time getting <<his>> words out. "Well, what I mean is I usually don't let my tools go, but as long as you come back I wouldn't... exactly be against it." <<He>> hesitates for a moment before striking you with <<his>> tendril, you feel a sort of severance. "Leave now. Before I change my mind."
<br><br>
<<if $bodyless is 1>>
	<<link [[Exit Pruti's Hut|Misland]]>>
		<<sleepDoll>><<stress -1000>>
		<<set $islanddistance to 45>>
		<<set $eventskip to 1>>
		<<set Skin.color.natural to "ghost">>
