:: Witch Help Cook 6
You push away the invasive thoughts and slowly will your body to cut the vegetables. You glance over to see Pruti's unsure face as <<he>> fumbles with the meat. You feel like this may be one of the only times you could see this kind of expression on Pruti's face. 
<br><br>
The vegetables and meat are placed into a pot and placed over the fire. Pruti quietly sits beside you and waits. <<He>> glances toward you, "Thank you for wanting to help, that was awfully kind of you. I'll be sure to put more effort into designing a better body for you." <<gglove>>
<br><br>
Before long, the food finishes. Pruti sits with you at the table, plating a meal for <<himself>> and begins to eat. You can see <<him>> wince from the bitter taste of the poorly prepared meat. You let out a silent laugh at the disgusted expression of Pruti.
<br><br>
After finishing, Pruti cleans the wooden plate in a bucket of water and gently guides you back to the corner designated for you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 5>><</link>>

:: Witch Hut Pruti Spend
You slowly nudge close, sitting alongside Pruti. <<He>> pays you little mind as <<he>> looks down into <<his>> book. 
<br><br>
<<He>> reaches over and makes a small red mark on another paper before turning and meeting your gaze. "Oh hello my beautiful doll, did you need something?"
<br><br>
You let Pruti know you just wanted to spend some time with <<him>>. <<He>> gives a small smile before returning <<his>> eyes to the page.
<br><br>
"Right now, I am working on building a new body to house your soul." Taking a closer look, you can see the paper <<he>> is drawing on has a complex diagram of symbols you have never seen before.
<br><br>
<<link [[Quietly watch Pruti work|Witch Hut Pruti Spend 2]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 3>><</link>><<glove>>

:: Witch Hut Pruti Spend 2
You quietly sit and watch Pruti work. As the paper grows with more symbols, you can see the silhouette of a human body forming on the paper.  
<br><br>
It looks like Pruti is making some kind of new enhanced doll body.
<br><br>
<<if $science gte 900>>
	Pruti pauses before drawing the next symbol but you notice something wrong. The most recent marking seems to have been drawn incorrectly, the limb joint seems to have been accidentally drawn backwards.
	<br><br>
	You gently tap <<his>> arm and grab his attention. "This symbol, shouldn't it be like this?" Your fingers tremble with effort as you gently correct the marking.
	<br><br>
	Pruti looks between you and the marking for a moment before giving a small smirk. "Smart doll, definitely mine." Pruti brushes a loving hand through your hair and returns to <<his>> work. <<npcincr Pruti love 2>><<glove>>
<<else>>
	Pruti pauses before drawing the next symbol. You wonder if you had paid more attention in school if you might have been able to understand some of this.
<</if>>
<br><br>
It's probably best to let <<him>> focus for now.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Trust Cook
You sidle up to Pruti and peek over <<his>> shoulder. You can see <<him>> beginning to struggle with the cut of meat, it seems like this genius isn't as gifted with cooking as <<he>> is in science.
<br><br>
As you gently grip <<his>> hand from behind, he lets you guide the knife. "Hello my doll, what's this?" <<He>> gives a small smirk as <<he>> glances your way before returning to the meat.
<br><br>
"You know I can handle the meat darling. It would help more to cut the vegetables to save time." Pruti says, but you know better than to believe it.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Trust Cook 2]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Trust Cook 2
You gently cut the meat. It looks like a dark meat, some kind of bird. Pruti lets out a sigh and a small smirk.
<br><br>
"Alright well then... If my doll has the meat covered, I will get to work on the vegetables." Pruti's lithe form disappears from your arms before you can even register, appearing beside you.
<br><br>
"Though be warned doll, if your meal is worse than mine, I won't let you hear the end of it." <<He>> teases, as <<he>> begins to dice vegetables.
<br><br>
<<link [[Continue to cut the meat (1:00)|Witch Trust Cook 3]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<br>
<span class="black">==Attempt to stab Pruti in the back==</span> <span class="red">You could never bring yourself to harm your owner</span>

:: Witch Trust Cook 3
Tending to the meat is tough, you wonder what kind of bird this was in life.
<br><br>
<<if $housekeeping gte 600>>
	You gut the meat before removing the bones, trimming the excess fat, and plunging the meat into the bucket of cold water.
	<br><br>
	Now clean and ready to continue, you cut the meat into bite sized pieces and slide them into the pot.
	<<set $prutimeal2 to 1>>
<<else>>
	You poke at the meat. You were sure you knew what you were doing, but now, left with the meat and your own thoughts, you are worried.
	<br><br>
	Maybe you should have paid more attention in housekeeping class.
	<br><br>
	You rinse the meat but struggle to cut through the gamey flesh. You gently slide the messy looking meat into the pot for cooking.
	<<set $prutimeal1 to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Pruti follows after, putting what look like carrots and some kind of tuberous root into the water.
<br><br>
You follow behind Pruti and place the pot over a fire lit near <<his>> chemistry table. It will take a while for the food to cook.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait with Pruti|Witch Trust Cook 4]]>><</link>>

:: Witch Trust Cook 4
<<prutihairdress>>

You sit beside Pruti. <<He>> gives a small smirk as <<he>> gently grips your arm and pulls you closer.
<br><br>
"Come now, darling. We have some time, lets get you looking nice and proper." Pruti grabs a hairbrush and pats <<his>> lap.
<br><br>
<span class="red">You must obey your owner. <<He>> only wants the best for you.</span>
<br><br>
By the time <<he>> is done, your hair is done up in a neat hairdo. "Well done holding still, my doll." Pruti purrs as <<he>> nuzzles gently into your neck with kisses.
<br><br>
You lose track of time, and before you even realize, the meal is finished cooking.
<br><br>
<<link [[Eat with Pruti (1:00)|Witch Trust Cook 5]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>

:: Witch Trust Cook 5
Pruti and you set the table, laying the smooth wooden plates and cutlery. Pruti pulls out a chair for you, gesturing for you to sit, before putting a helping of stew onto your plate.
<br><br>
<<if $prutimeal2 is 1 and $prutimeal1 isnot 1>>
	The plated meal looks great. The vegetables are al dente and the meat is soft and rich. Pruti looks visible impressed by your cooking prowess. <<gglove>> <<npcincr Pruti love 5>>
	<br><br>
	Pruti gently cuts a piece of meat and takes a bite. "Wow, my doll. You truly did wonders on this meat. It's so flavorful and has a perfect savory taste. Well done darling."
	<br><br>
	You are flashed a gentle and sincere smile as the two of you eat your hard cooked meal.
<<elseif $prutimeal2 is 1 and $prutimeal1 is 1>>
	The plated meal looks great. A drastic difference from your previous meals. The vegetables are al dente and the meat is soft and rich. Pruti looks visible impressed by your cooking prowess, yet is apprehensive to taste. <<glove>> <<npcincr Pruti love 5>>
	<br><br>
	Pruti gently cuts a piece of meat and braces before taking a bite. <<His>> face lightens as <<he>> chews, "Wow, my doll. You truly did wonders on this meat. It's so flavorful and has a perfect savory taste. Well done darling."
	<br><br>
	You are flashed a gentle and sincere smile as the two of you eat your hard cooked meal.
<<elseif $prutimeal1 is 1>>
	As the food is scooped onto your plates the two of you look down in disgust. The meat has melted in the pot into a thick gross slurry. You imagine the texture to be like eating tar.
	<br><br>
	Looking down at the ruined meal, Pruti is silent for a moment, before a small gentle laugh escapes <<his>> lips. "Wow my doll, and I thought I was bad at cooking. Is this even meat anymore?" <<glove>> <<npcincr Pruti love 3>>
	<br><br>
	Pruti teases you relentlessly for a few minutes before standing and returning to the kitchen. <<He>> returns moments later with a basket of raw vegetables.
	<br><br>
	"I guess this will have to do for now, huh?" <<He>> flashes a smug grin before taking a bite from what looks like a carrot.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The two of you finish the meal in no time and are ready to continue on with your day.
<br><br>
<<link [[Finish cleaning the plates and cutlery|Witch Hut Trust]]>><</link>>

